OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785926872
OL,3,CMan jailed for keeping mother's body
OL,4,Cin freezer for nearly three years
OL,6,FThe body of his mother, Sylvia
OL,7,FPhillips, 89, was found in a chest
OL,8,Ffreezer at the home they shared in
OL,9,FPorthcawl on 17 February.
OL,11,FOn Monday 3 August at Merthyr Tydfil
OL,12,FCrown Court, Judge Tracey Lloyd-
OL,13,FClarke, the Recorder of Cardiff,
OL,14,Fsentenced Phillips to two years and
OL,15,Ffour months' imprisonment.
OL,17,FFollowing his mother's death, for
OL,18,Fwhich the cause remains unknown, the
OL,19,Fdefendant purchased a chest freezer
OL,20,Fand used this to store her body inside
OL,21,Fthe living-room of the property.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
