CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785926872
OL,3,CMan jailed for keeping mother's body
OL,4,Cin freezer for nearly three years
OL,6,FAddressing the court, defence
OL,7,Fbarrister Ruth Smith said Phillips had
OL,8,Fpreviously been a "productive member
OL,9,Fof society" but had given up work in
OL,10,F2022 to provide full time care for his
OL,11,Fmother, to whom he was "exceptionally"
OL,12,Fclose.
OL,14,FShe said Phillips told a psychiatrist
OL,15,Fthat when his mother died he "didn't
OL,16,Fwant to let her go" , and spent a day
OL,17,Fholding her hand and telling her he
OL,18,Fwould look after her.
