PN,43404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785926872
OL,3,CMan jailed for keeping mother's body
OL,4,Cin freezer for nearly three years
OL,6,FHe later began sleeping in the same
OL,7,Froom as the freezer in order, Ms Smith
OL,8,Fsaid, to be close to the body.
OL,10,FThe court heard the body was covered
OL,11,Fwith a leopard print throw and found
OL,12,Falongside roses and a birthday card,
OL,13,Freading, "To Mum, from Christopher and
OL,14,FTina", a reference to the family dog.
OL,16,FPhillips received a total of
OL,17,F#78,190.92 in benefits following his
OL,18,Fmother's death.
